         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe have already learned what happens when there is nobody to share with, or when we divide by one: everything stays together in one place.\n\nWe also observed that when we share something with another person, either everybody keeps the same number of objects, or one object remains.\n\nBefore looking at other ways of sharing, let us study these previous situations a little more, so we do not create barriers that could block our learning.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "8bc341a0-b270-4cc8-b76c-eacfb6dd26b4",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "8bc341a0-b270-4cc8-b76c-eacfb6dd26b4",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "c137d968-eb5a-47e7-90b1-1c4cadd47ca9",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=c137d968-eb5a-47e7-90b1-1c4cadd47ca9",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Hands Again\n\nIn different classes we looked at our two hands side by side. We did this to count, and we also used them when we began to learn how to share.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<style>#leftHand{ transform:translateX(-140px); transform-origin:center; } #rightHand{  transform:translateX(140px);  transform-origin:center;}",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 200\"><g transform=\"translate(400,0) scale(0.6)\"><g id=\"leftHand\"><path class=\"hand-shape\" fill=\"#F4C2A1\"  d=\"M-268.1,338l21.7-21.7c2.3-2.3,3.5-5.3,3.5-8.5v-55.7c0-5.6,2.2-10.9,6.2-14.9l32.4-32.4 c2.1-2.1,5.8-1.8,7.4,0.8c2.8,4.4,5,11.4-1.4,18.9c-5.1,5.9-10.3,10.9-13.7,14.1 c-2.2,2-2.2,5.4-0.1,7.5c2,2,5.3,2,7.3,0l87.6-87.6c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-66.2,66.2c-2.4,2.4-2.4,6.4,0,8.8  c2.4,2.4,6.4,2.4,8.8,0l74.5-75.3c4.6-4.7,12.2-4.7,16.9,0l1.8,1.8  c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.1,0.1,16.8l-70.4,71.3c-2.2,2.3-2.2,5.9,0,8.2 c2.3,2.3,5.9,2.3,8.2,0l61.2-61.2c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0l0.2,0.2 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-67.1,67.1c-1.7,1.7-1.7,4.6,0,6.3 c1.7,1.7,4.6,1.7,6.3,0l50.7-50.7c3.9-3.9,10.1-3.9,13.9,0 c3.9,3.9,3.9,10.1,0,13.9l-98.2,98.2z\"/> </g> <g id=\"rightHand\" transform=\"scale(-1,1)\"> <path class=\"hand-shape\" fill=\"#F4C2A1\" d=\"M-268.1,338l21.7-21.7c2.3-2.3,3.5-5.3,3.5-8.5v-55.7c0-5.6,2.2-10.9,6.2-14.9l32.4-32.4 c2.1-2.1,5.8-1.8,7.4,0.8c2.8,4.4,5,11.4-1.4,18.9c-5.1,5.9-10.3,10.9-13.7,14.1 c-2.2,2-2.2,5.4-0.1,7.5c2,2,5.3,2,7.3,0l87.6-87.6c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-66.2,66.2c-2.4,2.4-2.4,6.4,0,8.8 c2.4,2.4,6.4,2.4,8.8,0l74.5-75.3c4.6-4.7,12.2-4.7,16.9,0l1.8,1.8 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.1,0.1,16.8l-70.4,71.3c-2.2,2.3-2.2,5.9,0,8.2 c2.3,2.3,5.9,2.3,8.2,0l61.2-61.2c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0l0.2,0.2 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-67.1,67.1c-1.7,1.7-1.7,4.6,0,6.3 c1.7,1.7,4.6,1.7,6.3,0l50.7-50.7c3.9-3.9,10.1-3.9,13.9,0 c3.9,3.9,3.9,10.1,0,13.9l-98.2,98.2z\"/> </g> </svg>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "Two open hands side by side, with fingers spread.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><b>Figure 1</b>: Two hands side by side.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "Whenever you wish, place your own hands in front of you and compare them with the figure: this will help us see what counting on a flat surface hides from us.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
