               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### There Is Something More\n\nPlace your hands in the position of Figure 1 and look at them from the side, as if you were going to grab something.\n\nIn that position we clearly see only two directions -- also called dimensions -- the horizontal and the vertical. But a third direction is present too: depth. It is there, but we do not see it.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><center><i class=\"fa-solid fa-hands-holding\" style=\"font-size:20em;color:#000;\"></i></center></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "Two hands positioned as if to hold something, seen from the side.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><b>Chart 1</b>: Hands positioned as if to grab something. Images available in the free version of Font Awesome (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
